:: Carter Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Carter: Park Clean Up")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and immediately notice a change in his demeanor. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>? <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas Taylor</span>?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is bad at hiding his obvious discomfort about the topic, rubbing the back of his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s cool. Yeah! Super cool and stuff. He’s super quiet these days though, but you would totally get along with him.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and spot a slight change in his expression. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>…? He’s really cool, but… well, uh… It’s hard to explain but he doesn’t really like me. Not because he’s mean or anything! No, it’s my fault. I kinda did some dumb stuff, so I don’t really blame him.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> shrugs, <span style="color:Pink">seeming a little embarrassed.</span> <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and spot a slight change in the redness of his cheeks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>? Yeah, he’s cool, but I guess you know that. You’re his friend, right? Why are you asking? Did- did he say anything about me? Not that he would! I’m just… ummm…”</span> <span style="color:Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems to have talked himself in a corner and just stares at you for a moment before quickly turning around and walking away.</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

